# Generated by forge build from forge/seed and the checkout's fixes. Do not edit: see docs/FORGE.md, "Fixing a generated guide".
# The Badlands and the Hinterlands, Alliance ~42.8 to ~43.3 (consensus visits
# 43-45). Flow: fly to Thelsamar > the Badlands (Sigrun, Garek, Murdaloc,
# Rigglefuzz, Camp Boff, the Scalding Whelps) > back to Thelsamar, fly to
# Southshore > ride to Aerie Peak > the Witherbark villages > fly to Menethil,
# boat to Theramore > fly to Nijel's Point, on the way to Feathermoon
# Stronghold, where the next guide starts.
#
# Grind: the previous guides dropped long detours (the Shimmering Flats stop,
# Teldrassil, Searing Gorge); to keep the level, this guide grinds to 43 on
# the Scalding Whelps while hunting Sigrun's Black Drake's Heart (a 2% drop,
# so the heart is optional).
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Pearl Diving (705), carried from 30-40/06-badlands with its pearls from
#   Stranglethorn's north-west coast, is handed in to Rigglefuzz on the ride
#   west to Camp Boff. Caught! (4449) is taken by a later guide at the
#   Searing Gorge outhouse.
# - The Southshore turn-in of Down the Scarlet Path (1052) is made here, on
#   the way from Thelsamar to Aerie Peak; there is no hearth to Southshore
#   (no bind there any more), so the guide flies from Thelsamar.
# - Aerie Peak and Feathermoon binds: Aerie Peak's is dropped (never used
#   before the next bind); the flight path and bind at Feathermoon belong to
#   the next guide, which starts there.
# - Cortello's Riddle part 2 (625, the Musty Scroll in western Dustwallow) is
#   not taken: a detour for one quest. Theramore stays for Akiris by the
#   Bundle (623): the boat lands next to Privateer Groy.
# - Troll Necklace Bounty's repeat (2881) is optional: hand in spare
#   necklaces only.
# - Aerie Peak: Fraggar (2880) on the way up, then Talonaxe beside the
#   flight master at the top.
# Left out: Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail (1452): never handed in on the route.
# Murdaloc (739) and Ironband Wants You! (707) are handed in by a later guide
# in Loch Modan. Class quests: Warlocks hand in Summon Felsteed (4488) at
# Ratchet, one flight from Theramore, before leaving.
guide forever/alliance/40-50/02-badlands
title Badlands & The Hinterlands
faction Alliance
levels 43-44
zone Badlands
next forever/alliance/40-50/03-feralas

# v1 improved: order from the simulator's search (Human Alliance, 2000000 tries, seeded with v1's order;
# 125.7 h -> 117.5 h to 60 in the model), written by polestar apply-route.
# Added here: Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail (1452).
# 6 goals moved in from other guides of the chain.
# The notes above describe v1's order; the steps below are the improved one.

step Fly to Thelsamar
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Thelsamar"

step Badlands
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Badlands
  goto 49.6,66.3 "Badlands"

step Agmond's End
  zone Badlands
  kill 2945 quest 739                 -- Murdaloc
  kill 2893 quest 739                 -- Stonevault Bonesnapper

step Boss Tho'grun
  tip Ride west across the Badlands to the Dustbelcher camp at Camp Boff. Boss Tho'grun stands in its middle with Wyrmhunters and Maulers around him.
  collect 4640 quest 732              -- Sign of the Earth

step Valley of Fangs
  turnin 1108                         -- Martek the Exiled
  accept 1137                         -- for Fizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats: the Tanaris guide crosses them at 45, keep it
  turnin 703                          -- Rigglefuzz
  turnin 705                          -- Blue Pearls from Stranglethorn
  note Rigglefuzz's next quest pays no experience: skip it.

step Garek
  tip Ride back east to Dustwind Gulch.
  turnin 732
  note Garek's next task is an elite hunt: skip it.

step Lethlor Ravine
  tip The Scalding Whelps nest in the ravine east of Garek; leave the Scorched Guardians (elite) alone. The Black Drake's Heart drops rarely: take it if it comes while you grind.
  collect 4612 quest 706 optional     -- Black Drake's Heart

step Hammertoe's Digsite
  turnin 706 optional                 -- Sigrun Ironhew

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Southshore and Aerie Peak

step Fly to Southshore
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 33.9,50.8 "Thelsamar flight master"
  fly "Southshore"

step Southshore
  when onquest 1052
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Ride north to Thelsamar and fly to Southshore. Raleigh the Devout preaches by the inn.
  turnin 1052                         -- Raleigh the Devout, upstairs
  note Raleigh's next errand is in the Scarlet Monastery: skip it.

step The Hinterlands
  zone The Hinterlands
  goto 11.8,46.8 "The Hinterlands"

step Aerie Peak
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Ride north-east out of Southshore on the road into the Hinterlands; Aerie Peak sits just past the border. Falstad holds court at the top, Gryphon Master Talonaxe tends the aviary and Fraggar Thundermantle stands by the inn.
  getfp "Aerie Peak"
  turnin 1449                         -- Falstad Wildhammer
  accept 1450
  turnin 1450                         -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe, inside
  accept 1451
  accept 2988
  accept 2880                         -- Fraggar Thundermantle, inside

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North

step Ironforge
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  zone Ironforge
  tip Fly from Gadgetzan to Theramore, take the boat to Menethil Harbor and fly to Ironforge. Train.
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Aerie Peak

step Aerie Peak
  zone The Hinterlands
  sethome "Aerie Peak" npc 7744       -- Innkeeper Thulfram: the last guide binds here, so this usually ticks at once; below ground
  accept 2877                         -- Fraggar Thundermantle, inside

step Rhapsody Shindigger
  tip Rhapsody camps on the road east of Aerie Peak.
  turnin 1451
  accept 1452

step Witherbark villages
  tip The first two cages stand together in the Witherbark village south of Rhapsody; the third is in the next village to the east. Every Witherbark troll can drop a necklace.
  interact 144068 quest 2988          -- Third Witherbark Cage
  interact 144067 quest 2988          -- Second Witherbark Cage
  collect 9259 quest 2880             -- Troll Tribal Necklace
  interact 144066 quest 2988          -- First Witherbark Cage

step Aerie Peak
  turnin 2880                         -- Fraggar Thundermantle, inside
  accept 2881 optional                -- Fraggar keeps paying for necklaces: hand in any extras
  turnin 2988                         -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe, beside the flight master at the top; inside
  note Talonaxe's next task waits for a later Hinterlands guide.
  accept 2989                         -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe

step Fly to Menethil Harbor
  zone The Hinterlands
  goto 11.1,46.1 "Aerie Peak flight master"
  fly "Menethil Harbor"
  zone Wetlands

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Theramore

step Boat to Theramore
  zone Wetlands
  goto 5.13,63.61 "Boat to Theramore"

step Theramore
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Privateer Groy stands on the docks where the boat lands.
  turnin 623                          -- Privateer Groy

step Cortello's Riddle
  when onquest 625
  turnin 625                          -- Inside Bloodfen Burrow

step Theramore flight master
  only Warlock
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  goto 67.5,51.2 "Theramore flight master"

step Warlock: Summon Felsteed
  only Warlock
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly to Ratchet; Strahad Farsan teaches in the house by the bank. Fly back to Theramore afterwards.
  fly "Ratchet"
  turnin 4488                         -- Strahad Farsan
  accept 4490
  turnin 4490
